{"total": 31.025102040816325, "lines": [{"text": "One thousand dollars, hidden in a cookie jar since 1996.", "start": 0.5, "dur": 3.423356009070295, "words": [{"w": "One", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.8133333333333332}, {"w": "thousand", "s": 0.8133333333333332, "e": 1.1266666666666665}, {"w": "dollars,", "s": 1.1266666666666665, "e": 1.44}, {"w": "hidden", "s": 1.44, "e": 1.78}, {"w": "in", "s": 1.78, "e": 1.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.94, "e": 2.02}, {"w": "cookie", "s": 2.02, "e": 2.1799999999999997}, {"w": "jar", "s": 2.1799999999999997, "e": 2.42}, {"w": "since", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.62}, {"w": "1996.", "s": 2.62, "e": 3.38}]}, {"text": "Thirty years later, every bill is still there.", "start": 4.243356009070295, "dur": 2.677233560090703, "words": [{"w": "Thirty", "s": 4.243356009070295, "e": 4.583356009070295}, {"w": "years", "s": 4.583356009070295, "e": 4.823356009070295}, {"w": "later,", "s": 4.823356009070295, "e": 5.143356009070295}, {"w": "every", "s": 5.403356009070295, "e": 5.543356009070295}, {"w": "bill", "s": 5.543356009070295, "e": 5.843356009070295}, {"w": "is", "s": 5.843356009070295, "e": 5.983356009070295}, {"w": "still", "s": 5.983356009070295, "e": 6.203356009070295}, {"w": "there.", "s": 6.203356009070295, "e": 6.543356009070295}]}, {"text": "Yet at today's prices, that stack only buys what $470 used to.", "start": 7.240589569160997, "dur": 5.063106575963719, "words": [{"w": "Yet", "s": 7.240589569160997, "e": 7.480589569160998}, {"w": "at", "s": 7.480589569160998, "e": 7.680589569160998}, {"w": "today's", "s": 7.680589569160998, "e": 8.140589569160998}, {"w": "prices,", "s": 8.140589569160998, "e": 8.580589569160997}, {"w": "that", "s": 8.960589569160998, "e": 9.020589569160997}, {"w": "stack", "s": 9.020589569160997, "e": 9.280589569160998}, {"w": "only", "s": 9.280589569160998, "e": 9.600589569160997}, {"w": "buys", "s": 9.600589569160997, "e": 9.900589569160998}, {"w": "what", "s": 9.900589569160998, "e": 10.200589569160996}, {"w": "$470", "s": 10.2005895691